@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch17ch18-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch17ch18-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 17 and 18"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.9.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch17ch18-lineage/1.9.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch17ch18_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.9.0 (2026-11-11): Change request, Objective stage only. Baseline measured from the live story-companion scripts of chapters 1-18 by comparing who, when and source link: chapter 17 story 3 (Microsoft, Ecma TC45, ECMA-376 in December 2006) tells the story already told in chapter 14 (OoxmlStandard2006); chapter 18 story 3 (Crockford and Morningstar, State Software, April 2001) tells the story already told in chapters 7 and 10; both share a source link or the same event and people. The ZIP story of chapter 17 was already replaced in draft v1.0.1 and is not counted. A comparison by who, when and link finds a lower bound only."""@en .

ex:Obj7_StoriesNotRepeated a backlog:Objective ;
    rdfs:label "Unconfirmed repeated stories in the chapter 17-18 drafts: 2 -> 0"@en ;
    backlog:objectiveForGoal ex:G7_StoriesNotRepeated ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage7 ;
    backlog:hasMetric ex:Metric_Obj7_StoriesNotRepeated ; backlog:hasForecastDate "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date .
ex:Metric_Obj7_StoriesNotRepeated a backlog:Metric ; rdfs:label "Count of stories in the ch17-18 drafts that repeat a story of chapters 1-16 without the owner's confirmation"@en ;
    backlog:metricUnit "story" ; backlog:metricBaseline 2 ; backlog:metricTarget 0 .
ex:Obs0_Obj7_StoriesNotRepeated a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj7_StoriesNotRepeated ;
    backlog:observedValue 2 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-11T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Baseline from the live story scripts: ch17 story 3 repeats ch14; ch18 story 3 repeats ch7 and ch10."@en .
